        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No frena las apariciones"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't flag" : {
      "comment" : "The button that declines the review panel's offer to flag a card the user forgot often: the card stays in their reviews.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nicht markieren"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No marcar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done" : {
      "comment" : "A button that closes the review panel once every card was gone through.\nThe Import sheet's button that closes it once the cards came in.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fertig"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Listo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Double-click a tag to see its cards, or right-click it for what you can do with it. Drag tags onto another to move them inside, between two rows to move them to that level, or into the sidebar to pin them." : {
      "comment" : "In the Cards window's detail, beside All Tags: what Lucas does with a tag there.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Doppelklicke auf ein Schlagwort, um seine Karten zu sehen, oder klicke mit der rechten Maustaste darauf, um zu sehen, was du damit tun kannst. Ziehe Schlagwörter auf ein anderes, um sie hineinzubewegen, zwischen zwei Zeilen, um sie auf diese Ebene zu bewegen, oder in die Seitenleiste, um sie anzupinnen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hacé doble clic en una etiqueta para ver sus tarjetas, o clic derecho para ver qué podés hacer con ella. Arrastrá etiquetas sobre otra para moverlas adentro, entre dos filas para moverlas a ese nivel, o a la barra lateral para fijarlas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop or paste a sound" : {
      "comment" : "In the empty place for the sound on a side of a card.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ton hierher ziehen oder einsetzen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Soltá o pegá un sonido"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop or paste an image" : {
      "comment" : "In the empty place for the image on a side of a card.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bild hierher ziehen oder einsetzen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Soltá o pegá una imagen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Due" : {
      "comment" : "A column of the Cards window: when the card is due.\nIn the Cards window's detail: when the card is due.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fällig"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pendiente"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each “Again” to a card out of its learning and relearning steps counts, since the card's front or back last changed. If you don't flag it, the panel offers again after half as many more." : {
      "comment" : "Settings, under Review panel: below the offer to flag a card forgotten often, which counts Anki's lapses. “Again” is the review panel's button, as Anki names it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jedes „Nochmal“ für eine Karte außerhalb ihrer Lern- und Wiedererlernstufen zählt, seit Vorder- oder Rückseite der Karte zuletzt geändert wurde. Wenn du sie nicht markierst, bietet das Fenster es nach halb so vielen weiteren erneut an."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuenta cada «Otra vez» a una tarjeta fuera de sus pasos en la etapa de aprendizaje y de reaprendizaje, desde la última vez que cambió su anverso o su reverso. Si no la marcás, el panel lo vuelve a ofrecer cuando sume la mitad de esa cantidad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Easy" : {
      "comment" : "A rating, Anki's fourth button, as the review panel's button names it and the Cards window's review log shows it: Lucas knew the card at once. Anki's own name for it, “Fácil” in Spanish.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Einfach"
