    "macOS didn't let %@ start at login (%@). Try again, or add it in System Settings > General > Login Items." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS hat %1$@ nicht erlaubt, bei der Anmeldung zu starten (%2$@). Versuche es erneut oder füge es unter „Systemeinstellungen“ > „Allgemein“ > „Anmeldeobjekte“ hinzu."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS didn't let %1$@ start at login (%2$@). Try again, or add it in System Settings > General > Login Items."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS no dejó que %1$@ se abra al iniciar sesión (%2$@). Probá de nuevo, o agregala en Configuración del Sistema > General > Elementos de inicio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS didn't stop %@ from starting at login (%@). Try again, or remove it in System Settings > General > Login Items." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS hat %1$@ nicht daran gehindert, bei der Anmeldung zu starten (%2$@). Versuche es erneut oder entferne es unter „Systemeinstellungen“ > „Allgemein“ > „Anmeldeobjekte“."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS didn't stop %1$@ from starting at login (%2$@). Try again, or remove it in System Settings > General > Login Items."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS no impidió que %1$@ se abra al iniciar sesión (%2$@). Probá de nuevo, o quitala en Configuración del Sistema > General > Elementos de inicio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS gave no folder for the App Group %@, which holds your cards. Quit the app and open it again, and if it keeps happening, report it." : {
      "comment" : "An alert at launch, and in the widget, under that it can't read the cards. The value is the App Group's identifier, such as ABCDE12345.com.lucastkacz.ficha, which stays as it is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS hat keinen Ordner für die App Group %@ angegeben, die deine Karten enthält. Beende die App und öffne sie erneut, und wenn das weiter passiert, melde es."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS no dio ninguna carpeta para el App Group %@, que guarda tus tarjetas. Salí de la app y volvé a abrirla y, si sigue pasando, reportalo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS refused the shortcut (error %d). Restart the app, and if it keeps failing, report it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS hat den Kurzbefehl abgelehnt (Fehler %d). Starte die App neu, und wenn es weiter fehlschlägt, melde es."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS rechazó el atajo (error %d). Reiniciá la app y, si sigue fallando, reportalo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "now" : {
      "comment" : "In the Cards window's Due and Back-first due columns: the card is due, front first or back first.",
