    },
    "—" : {
      "comment" : "In the Cards window's review log, in place of the seconds Lucas took, when nothing measured them.",
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "“%@” can't go inside Default, which holds the cards no other deck does and has no decks inside it, so nothing changed. Move it inside another deck, or to the top." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ kann nicht in „Standard“ liegen, der die Karten enthält, die in keinem anderen Stapel sind, und keine Stapel darin hat, daher hat sich nichts geändert. Bewege ihn in einen anderen Stapel oder auf die oberste Ebene."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» no puede ir dentro de Predeterminado, que guarda las tarjetas que no están en ningún otro mazo y no tiene mazos adentro, así que no cambió nada. Movelo dentro de otro mazo, o al primer nivel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” can't go inside itself, or inside a deck inside it, so nothing changed. Pick a deck outside it." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ kann nicht in sich selbst oder in einem Stapel darin liegen, daher hat sich nichts geändert. Wähle einen Stapel außerhalb davon."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» no puede ir dentro de sí mismo, ni dentro de un mazo que está adentro de él, así que no cambió nada. Elegí un mazo de afuera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” can't go inside itself, or inside a tag inside it, so nothing changed. Pick a tag outside it." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ kann nicht in sich selbst oder in einem Schlagwort darin liegen, daher hat sich nichts geändert. Wähle ein Schlagwort außerhalb davon."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» no puede ir dentro de sí misma, ni dentro de una etiqueta que está adentro de ella, así que no cambió nada. Elegí una etiqueta de afuera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” holds no sound Ficha can read. Give a sound or a video with sound as a side's sound instead, such as an MP3, an M4A or a MOV, and a picture as its image." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ enthält keinen Ton, den Ficha lesen kann. Gib stattdessen einen Ton oder ein Video mit Ton als Ton einer Seite an, etwa eine MP3-, M4A- oder MOV-Datei, und ein Bild als ihr Bild."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» no tiene ningún sonido que Ficha pueda leer. Como sonido de un lado, pasá un sonido o un video con sonido, como un MP3, un M4A o un MOV, y como su imagen, una imagen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” holds no text file of cards: Ficha looks for one ending in .txt, .csv or .tsv beside the images and sounds. Add it, zip them again, and import that." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ enthält keine Textdatei mit Karten: Ficha sucht neben den Bildern und Tönen eine, die auf .txt, .csv oder .tsv endet. Füge sie hinzu, komprimiere alles erneut und importiere das."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» no tiene ningún archivo de texto de tarjetas: Ficha busca uno que termine en .txt, .csv o .tsv junto a las imágenes y los sonidos. Agregalo, volvé a comprimirlos en un zip, e importá eso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” holds several text files of cards, %@, and Ficha imports one at a time. Zip each with its images and sounds on its own, and import them one by one." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%1$@“ enthält mehrere Textdateien mit Karten, %2$@, und Ficha importiert jeweils nur eine. Komprimiere jede einzeln mit ihren Bildern und Tönen und importiere sie nacheinander."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%1$@» tiene varios archivos de texto de tarjetas, %2$@, y Ficha importa uno por vez. Comprimí cada uno en un zip aparte con sus imágenes y sonidos, e importalos de a uno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is Default's name, and Default holds the cards no other deck does, so nothing changed. To move cards there, pick Default; to make a deck, write another name." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ ist der Name von „Standard“, und „Standard“ enthält die Karten, die in keinem anderen Stapel sind, daher hat sich nichts geändert. Um Karten dorthin zu bewegen, wähle „Standard“; um einen Stapel zu erstellen, schreibe einen anderen Namen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» es el nombre de Predeterminado, y Predeterminado guarda las tarjetas que no están en ningún otro mazo, así que no cambió nada. Para mover tarjetas ahí, elegí Predeterminado; para crear un mazo, escribí otro nombre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is one of the types Ficha comes with, so nothing changed. Pick that type, or write another name." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ ist einer der Typen, die Ficha mitbringt, daher hat sich nichts geändert. Wähle diesen Typ oder schreibe einen anderen Namen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» es uno de los tipos que trae Ficha, así que no cambió nada. Elegí ese tipo, o escribí otro nombre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is set aside, and a deck is never both set aside and a priority deck, nor is a deck inside it, so nothing changed. Stop setting it aside first." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ ist zurückgestellt, und ein Stapel ist nie zugleich zurückgestellt und Prioritätsstapel, ebenso wenig ein Stapel darin, daher hat sich nichts geändert. Hebe zuerst das Zurückstellen auf."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» está apartado, y un mazo nunca está apartado y es prioritario a la vez, ni tampoco un mazo de adentro, así que no cambió nada. Primero dejá de apartarlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” isn't UTF-8 text, which is what Ficha reads. Save it again as UTF-8 text, or from a spreadsheet as “CSV UTF-8”, and import that." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ ist kein UTF-8-Text, und nur den liest Ficha. Sichere die Datei erneut als UTF-8-Text oder aus einer Tabellenkalkulation als „CSV UTF-8“ und importiere das."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» no es texto UTF-8, que es lo que lee Ficha. Guardalo de nuevo como texto UTF-8, o desde una planilla como «CSV UTF-8», e importá eso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” isn't an image Ficha can read. Give a picture as a side's image instead, such as a JPEG or a PNG, and a sound as its sound." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ ist kein Bild, das Ficha lesen kann. Gib stattdessen ein Bild als Bild einer Seite an, etwa eine JPEG- oder PNG-Datei, und einen Ton als ihren Ton."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» no es una imagen que Ficha pueda leer. Como imagen de un lado, pasá una imagen, como un JPEG o un PNG, y como su sonido, un sonido."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” isn't an image or a sound Ficha can read. Give a picture instead, such as a JPEG or a PNG, or a sound or a video with sound, such as an MP3, an M4A or a MOV." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ ist weder ein Bild noch ein Ton, den Ficha lesen kann. Gib stattdessen ein Bild an, etwa eine JPEG- oder PNG-Datei, oder einen Ton oder ein Video mit Ton, etwa eine MP3-, M4A- oder MOV-Datei."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» no es una imagen ni un sonido que Ficha pueda leer. Pasá una imagen en su lugar, como un JPEG o un PNG, o un sonido o un video con sonido, como un MP3, un M4A o un MOV."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” isn't pinned to the sidebar, maybe since another of your devices unpinned it, so nothing moved. Pin it first." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ ist nicht in der Seitenleiste angepinnt, vielleicht weil ein anderes deiner Geräte es gelöst hat, daher wurde nichts bewegt. Pinne es zuerst an."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "«%@» no está fijada en la barra lateral, quizás porque otro de tus dispositivos la quitó, así que no se movió nada. Primero fijala."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” was exported by an Anki newer than Ficha knows. In Anki, export the deck again with “Support older Anki versions” ticked, and import that." : {
      "comment" : "A message of an error of Ficha's engine, EngineError, which the app and the widget show. Added by hand, since Xcode doesn't extract FichaKit's texts: EngineMessagesTests checks every message is here.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ wurde von einer Anki-Version exportiert, die neuer ist als alle, die Ficha kennt. Exportiere den Stapel in Anki erneut mit angehaktem „Unterstütze ältere Anki-Versionen“ und importiere das."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
